<?xml version='1.0'?>
<!--
  Colours for the Go attribute keys that GoLand gives an explicit value in the Darcula family,
  so a scheme that does not mention Go still paints Go the way GoLand does. Keys whose colour
  GoLand leaves to a fallback are absent here on purpose: their fallback already agrees.

  A scheme that names one of these keys itself wins over this file, which is what keeps a
  GoLand-tuned theme in charge of its own choices.
-->
